sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Device or app
    participant T as Token endpoint
    participant B as MQTT broker
    C->>T: HTTPS mTLS POST /request_token<br/>scope and devid
    alt Certificate and policy authorize the request
        T-->>C: access_token and mqtt metadata<br/>aws_credentials when requested
        C->>B: MQTT CONNECT over TLS<br/>username, client ID, token as password
        alt Token, identity, and MQTT capability are valid
            B-->>C: CONNACK success
        else Invalid or unauthorized connection
            B-->>C: Connection refused
        end
    else Certificate or policy rejected
        T-->>C: TLS failure or HTTP error
    end
